# Static/Media
# We keep static files in source control if they are assets, but maybe not collected ones if using a separate bucket. 
# For this simple deployment, checking in 'static' source is good.
# checking in 'staticfiles' (collected) is usually not needed if we collect on build.
staticfiles/
backend/staticfiles/

# Media - User uploads typically shouldn't be in repo, but for this app we might not be saving them persistently.
# If we were, we'd add 'media/' here.
media/
backend/media/
